      "name": "IPIP TCI",
      "abbreviation": "IPIP-TCI",
      "description": "Meta-scale aggregating all 30 IPIP-TCI subscales. Each subscale is a separate section controlled by a boolean parameter. Intended primarily for translation and bulk administration.",
